  <h2>How long before 618 should production start?</h2>

  <p>No source says, so this section is arithmetic, and it is labeled that way throughout. Choose a lead time you trust from your own past cycles, and count it back from a reported opening. The table uses sixteen weeks only because it is the brief's working window, not because any source recommends it.</p>

  <blockquote class="evidence">Counted back sixteen weeks from Tmall's reported 21 May 2026 opening, the plan starts on 29 January 2026, and the nine-day Spring Festival holiday lands between roughly T minus 14 and T minus 12 weeks.</blockquote>
  <p class="source">Source: date arithmetic, 10 September 2026, on the platform's reported opening and the State Council holiday notice, not a published lead time.</p>

  <blockquote class="evidence">China's 2026 Spring Festival holiday ran from 15 to 23 February, nine days, with Saturday 14 February and Saturday 28 February worked as makeup days. The Dragon Boat Festival holiday runs 19 to 21 June and National Day 1 to 7 October.</blockquote>
  <p class="source">Source: State Council General Office notice on the 2026 public holiday schedule, published 4 November 2025. Official government notice.</p>

